[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0551","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0551.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0335","title":"多款 Unix 系统 lpr 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"该漏洞为 BSD 系系统中 lpr 命令处理 -C（classification）命令行选项时的缓冲区溢出漏洞。lpr 程序未对用户输入的 -C 参数长度进行充分校验，本地攻击者可构造超长字符串作为 -C 参数传入，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 BSD/OS 2.1、FreeBSD 2.1.5、NeXTstep 4.x、IRIX 6.4、SunOS 4.1.3/4.1.4 及基于 BSD 的 Linux 系统，CVSS v2 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0335"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-08-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:54:57Z","remediation":"DUPLICATE: CVE-1999-0335 is a duplicate of CVE-1999-0032. Refer to CVE-1999-0032 for the canonical vulnerability entry. No AVE entry generated.","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19544","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/af5cedcf472f3690d94c4249ff35246f15692534/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0335.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0335","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ec31d5593e31331ed2058e001803e087d65aa416/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0335.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5jj5-vh28-7x64/GHSA-5jj5-vh28-7x64.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0335.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000092.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0551.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0287","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0287.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0136","title":"Sun Microsystems Solaris KCMS 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 系统中 Kodak 色彩管理系统（KCMS）存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者利用 KCMS 组件对文件操作权限校验不严的缺陷，可向任意系统文件写入恶意数据，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Sun Solaris 操作系统，攻击者需拥有本地账户作为前置条件，无需其他认证。成功利用后可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0136"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-07-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:40Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 官方补丁（Solaris 2.5 对应补丁 ID 103093-01，Solaris 2.5.1 对应补丁 ID 103094-01）以修复 KCMS 组件权限问题；如无法打补丁，可临时移除 KCMS 相关 setuid 二进制文件（如 /usr/dt/bin/kcms_calibrate）的 setuid 位以阻止本地提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0136"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0287.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0286","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0286.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0135","title":"Sun Solaris admintool 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris admintool 存在基于符号链接的任意文件写入漏洞。本地用户可通过在 /tmp 目录下创建恶意符号链接，诱使以 root 权限运行的 admintool 向系统任意位置写入数据，进而覆盖 /etc/passwd 等关键文件实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.3 至 2.6 版本，攻击者需具备本地用户账户，利用条件简单，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0135"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-07-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:40Z","remediation":"立即安装 Solaris 厂商安全补丁（如 Sun Patch 106874），升级到未受影响的 Solaris 版本；临时缓解措施可移除 admintool 的 setuid 权限（chmod 4755 /usr/bin/admintool）或通过 group 限制仅允许受信任管理员执行该工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0135"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0286.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0077","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0023","title":"多个Unix系统厂商 rdist 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"rdist 工具的 lookup() 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户通过向该函数传递特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存数据并获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 BSDI BSD/OS 2.1、FreeBSD 2.1、IBM AIX 4.2、SGI IRIX 6.4、Sun SunOS 4.1.3 等多个 UNIX 系统。攻击者需拥有本地账号并具备调用 rdist 的权限，无需网络远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0023"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-07-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:22Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 2.1.5 或更高版本；SunOS 4.1.3 安装补丁 102079-05，Solaris 安装补丁 103600；AIX 升级至 4.2.1 或安装 APAR IX67810；IRIX 安装 SGI 补丁 1695 或升级至 6.5；BSDi 升级至 BSD/OS 2.1.1。如无法立即升级，可移除 rdist 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/rdist）并改用 rsync 替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0023","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19106"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0075","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0075.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0023","title":"多款Unix系统 rdist 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"rdist 远程文件分发工具的 lookup() 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可利用特制输入触发栈缓冲区溢出，覆盖返回地址或函数指针，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 BSDI BSD/OS 2.1、FreeBSD 2.1、IBM AIX 4.2、SGI IRIX 6.4、Sun SunOS 4.1.3 等多个 Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地账户并执行恶意构造的 rdist 命令即可提权至 root。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0023"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-07-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 rdist 至安全版本（如 FreeBSD 2.2.1 及以上、SunOS 5.5.1 及以上），禁用 rdist 的 setuid 位 (`chmod u-s /usr/bin/rdist`)，并在非必要环境下彻底移除 rdist 服务端或改用 rsync 替代。对仍运行 AIX 4.2/IRIX 6.4 等已停止支持的系统，建议迁移至现代操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0023","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19106","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dc83b9e6d88de194a14e3020b4e71ac42054e609/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0023.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0023","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0023.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0023.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/04a84e78299e2aeaab4d2594fc26f920778c7b06/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0023.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p5x8-wgxf-7w54/GHSA-p5x8-wgxf-7w54.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0023.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2250a918-956c-42c3-8640-fd1457b43a36.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0075.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1561","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1561.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1572","title":"cpio 本地文件权限漏洞","description":"cpio 在 FreeBSD 2.1.0、Debian GNU/Linux 3.0 及可能其他操作系统中存在不安全文件权限漏洞。当使用 -O（归档）或 -F 选项创建文件时，cpio 将 umask 设置为 0，导致创建的文件权限为 0666（全局可读写）。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞读取或覆盖这些文件，从而获取敏感信息或破坏系统数据完整性。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1572"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1996-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:44Z","remediation":"将 cpio 升级至包含补丁的版本（cpio main.c rev 1.3 及以上）。Debian 用户安装 DSA-664 更新，Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2005-073/RHSA-2005-080 更新。如无法升级，避免使用 -O 和 -F 选项创建归档文件，或在使用前手动设置 umask 为 077 以限制文件权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=110763404701519&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/14357","http://secunia.com/advisories/17063","http://secunia.com/advisories/17532","http://support.avaya.com/elmodocs2/security/ASA-2005-212.pdf","http://www.debian.org/security/2005/dsa-664","http://www.freebsd.org/cgi/query-pr.cgi?pr=bin/1391","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2005:032","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2005-073.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2005-080.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2005-806.html","http://www.trustix.org/errata/2005/0003/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/19167","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A10888","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/1999/CVE-1999-1572.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1572.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1572","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-1999-1572","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1572.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1572.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2005-073.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2005-080.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dfcf08c3-6c22-48bd-bdc4-38134a61eb4a.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-1999-1572"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1561.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1464","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1464.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1301","title":"FreeBSD rzsz Z-Modem 协议远程代码执行漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 2.1.5 之前版本中 rzsz 模块所实现的 Z-Modem 协议存在设计缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向客户端发送特制文件触发该漏洞，在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 2.1.5 之前版本及其他使用 rzsz 实现的系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者只需诱骗目标使用 rz 接收文件即可完成利用，无需身份认证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1301"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:08Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 2.1.5 或更高版本，该版本修复了 rzsz 模块中 Z-Modem 协议实现的设计缺陷。如无法升级，建议禁用 rz 自动接收功能，并在网络层面限制对运行 rz 服务的端口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/g-31.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7540.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/851a313c6bc1948d5487aca773aa21ade52b7c28/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1301.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1301","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1301.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1301.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-57xw-6c7g-xh67/GHSA-57xw-6c7g-xh67.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1301.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000089.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7a0517f4-bfeb-4736-973e-112eedebb156.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1464.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0288","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0288.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0137","title":"Linux dip 本地缓冲区溢出提权漏洞","description":"Linux 系统中 dip（Dial-up IP）程序 3.3.7 版本存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 dip 程序在处理用户输入时未正确校验缓冲区边界，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞向 dip 程序发送精心构造的超长参数触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，攻击者需拥有系统本地访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0137"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-07-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:40Z","remediation":"升级 dip 至 3.7.3 或更高版本以修复缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，立即执行 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/dip` 移除 dip 二进制文件的 setuid 权限位作为临时缓解。现代 Linux 发行版已不再包含 dip，建议彻底卸载 dip 软件包并改用 pppd 替代 SLIP/PPP 拨号功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0137","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19078","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab669d9fb37e52ed0619cb2b8265d34528fbe875/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0137.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0137","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0137.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0137.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0137.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6hwp-66fm-v8h9/GHSA-6hwp-66fm-v8h9.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0137.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/86/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0288.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0071","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0022","title":"FreeBSD rdist 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0022 是 FreeBSD 系统中 rdist 远程文件分发工具的 expstr() 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于该函数未对输入长度进行有效边界检查，本地攻击者可构造特制数据触发缓冲区越界读取，从而将权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响多个 FreeBSD 版本，攻击者需具备本地系统账户权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0022"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:22Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 6.4-RELEASE 或更高版本（rdist 自 FreeBSD 7.0 起已从 base 系统移除，建议直接移除 rdist 或移除其 setuid 位：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/rdist`）。如无法升级，卸载 rdist 软件包或通过 `chflags schg /usr/bin/rdist` 防止篡改利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/179"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0349","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0349.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0175","title":"Novell NetWare Web Server 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Novell NetWare Web Server 2.x 的 convert.bas 程序存在未授权文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可利用该脚本读取 Web 服务器内部可访问的任意文件。该漏洞可能泄露系统配置文件、密码文件及敏感业务数据，进而为后续攻击提供信息支撑。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0175"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-07-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:45Z","remediation":"立即删除或重命名 Web 服务端 scripts 目录下的 convert.bas 文件以消除文件读取风险；升级至 Novell NetWare 5.1 或更高版本（该版本改用基于 Netscape 的企业级 Web 服务器，不再包含 convert.bas）；如仍在运行已停止支持的 NetWare 平台，应尽快迁移至 SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 或 Windows Server 等现代操作系统。临时缓解措施可在防火墙或 Web 服务器配置中限制对 scripts 目录的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0175","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20448","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/269e5b2b6ea60fdb4a03411be38d3e381b26e4c4/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0175.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0175","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0175.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0175.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2f876a2c24d5ccd5bbd081f09e801e580536456a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0175.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g2vw-843m-4hr9/GHSA-g2vw-843m-4hr9.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-misc.rules","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0175.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0349.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0289","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0289.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0138","title":"Perl suidperl 权限提升漏洞","description":"suidperl 和 sperl 程序在处理 setuid 脚本时存在权限提升漏洞。当切换 UID 回原始用户时，这两个程序未能正确释放 root 权限，导致本地普通用户可利用此缺陷获取超级用户权限。攻击者通过精心构造的 setuid Perl 脚本触发此漏洞，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响早期多个 UNIX 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0138"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-06-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:40Z","remediation":"升级 Perl 至 5.004 或更高版本，该版本修复了 suidperl 在切换回原始用户 UID 时未正确丢弃 root 权限的问题。如无法立即升级，执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/suidperl /usr/bin/sperl 移除 suid 特权位作为临时缓解措施；同时建议使用 sudo 替代 suidperl 机制，或使用 C 包装程序调用 Perl 脚本来避免内核竞态条件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0138"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0289.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1395","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1395.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1205","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9127,\"outputTokens\":18,\"totalTokens\":10809}}","description":"HP-UX 10.00 和 10.01 版本中的 nettune 工具以 setuid root 权限安装，导致本地用户可通过修改关键网络配置信息触发拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于 nettune 程序以 root 权限运行且缺乏适当的权限检查，本地攻击者可利用该工具修改关键网络配置参数，导致网络服务中断或系统网络功能瘫痪。攻击条件要求攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，利用方式为直接调用 nettune 工具修改网络配置参数。CVSS 评分 2.1，属于低危本地拒绝服务漏洞，影响范围限于 HP-UX 10.00 和 10.01 版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1205"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-06-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:56Z","remediation":"升级到 HP-UX 10.20 或更高版本以修复该缺陷；在无法立即升级时，使用 chmod u-s /usr/sbin/nettune 移除 nettune 的 setuid root 权限，并限制仅 root 可访问，防止本地用户篡改关键网络配置引发拒绝服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167419195&w=2","http://packetstormsecurity.org/advisories/ibm-ers/96-08","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/414","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1205.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2126251525a2d370ea93bd7affc3a9b71b419b4c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1205.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1205","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d281505551869bb381f43b6d1c6cb3abf45ad885/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1205.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1205.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1205.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87927/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3a9247bd-e6da-452a-8f08-55dbae981900.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1205.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1395.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1428","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1428.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1253","title":"SCO OpenServer和SCO Internet FastStart 内核错误处理权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO OpenServer 5.0.2及更早版本与SCO Internet FastStart 1.0的内核错误处理例程中存在权限许可和访问控制漏洞。本地用户可通过向系统发送特制请求触发内核错误处理缺陷，绕过安全检查并获取root权限。该漏洞影响范围广，攻击条件为拥有本地访问权限，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1253"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1996-06-07T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装SCO安全公告SB.96:01a提供的内核补丁修复错误处理例程中的权限缺陷。对于无法安装补丁的系统，限制非信任用户的本地登录访问并通过最小权限原则严格控制用户对内核接口的调用权限。由于SCO OpenServer 5.0.x已停止维护，建议迁移至仍受支持的操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/vendor_bulletins/VB-96.10.sco","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1965"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1428.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0763","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0763.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0509","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9109,\"outputTokens\":22,\"totalTokens\":10795}}","description":"WWW 站点的 cgi-bin 目录下错误地部署了 Perl、sh、csh 等脚本解释器程序，而非普通 CGI 脚本。远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 请求直接访问并执行这些解释器，向其传递特制参数从而在目标 Web 服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响所有将 shell 解释器置于 Web 可访问 cgi-bin 目录的站点，攻击条件仅为攻击者能向目标站点发起 HTTP 请求，无需身份认证，可导致服务器被完全控制、数据泄露或沦为跳板，危害等级极严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0509"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:32Z","remediation":"立即从 Web 服务器 cgi-bin 目录中删除或移走 perl、sh、csh 等 shell 解释器脚本（如 perl、test-cgi 等），禁止将任何解释器置于可执行 CGI 路径下；在 Apache 等服务器配置中关闭不必要的 CGI 执行权限（如注释 ScriptAlias 或设置 Options -ExecCGI），并将 CGI 程序严格限制在受信任目录并仅保留必要的编译后二进制；同时升级 Web 服务器到已修复该默认配置的安全版本（如 Apache 1.3.27+/IIS 4.0 SP6a+），并以低权限专用账户运行 web 服务以减小危害。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/146","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0509.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2f8583cd0e244c401900c481a78c07fe5535c09f/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0509.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0509","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e2d061a60b9c6823d20cc72e51f709fadad54d2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0509.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0509.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/808b57c97f3c3a63ccc1ba2e5715700b4df9d9e8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fr45-fgh4-2qmm/GHSA-fr45-fgh4-2qmm.json","https://github.com/briandfoy/cpan-security-advisory/blob/228de67a7a4b13d017ca4a324923e49c94625191/IGNORE_CVEs","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/shells.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83213/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0763.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0779","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0779.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0522","title":"Sun NIS+ 系统关键表权限配置不当漏洞","description":"NIS+（网络信息服务增强版）中系统关键表（如 passwd）的权限设置不当，可能导致未授权用户读取或修改该表中的敏感账户信息。NIS+ 服务常用于 UNIX 环境下的集中用户管理，若 passwd 表权限配置过于宽松，远程攻击者可利用该缺陷获取系统账户哈希值，进而通过离线破解获取明文密码，或直接修改账户信息实现未授权访问。该漏洞影响早期 Solaris 等使用 NIS+ 服务的 UNIX 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。修复措施包括严格限制 NIS+ 表的访问权限并遵循最小权限原则进行配置。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0522"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-05-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:34Z","remediation":"应限制 NIS+ 表（passwd, hosts, cred 等）权限为仅 root 可读写，使用 nischmod 命令将表权限设为 644 或更严格，通过 nisgrpadm 控制域访问范围。启用 NIS+ 的 DES 认证及 secure_rpc 防止未授权读取。如已停止维护，建议迁移至 LDAP + Kerberos 作为长期目录服务方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0522"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0779.toml"}]